.table 13 19 28
Key | What it does | Described in
{k:Ctrl-F1} | Learn: starts the recording of a macro, and ends it | {x:edit-c-macro-learn}
{k:Ctrl-F2} | Math: calculates the highlighted numbers | {x:edit-c-math}
{k:Ctrl-F3} | Lib Copy | {x:edit-c-library-keys}
