.ix Alt-Ins
.ix Modifier keys, combinations
.ix Keys with the same meaning
Some combinations of Shift, Ctrl and Alt with a cursor key, with Ins or with
a function key do what a simpler key does.  The table lists the combinations
that a user is likely to press; the keys that have a command of their own are
in the tables above.
.table 24 36
Key | What it does
