{k:Ctrl-Shift-F1} to {k:Ctrl-Shift-F12} | The same as {k:Ctrl-F1} to
 {k:Ctrl-F12}.
{k:Ctrl-Up}, {k:Ctrl-Down}, {k:Alt-Left}, {k:Alt-Right}, {k:Alt-Up},
 {k:Alt-Down}, {k:Alt-PgUp}, {k:Alt-PgDn}, {k:Alt-Home}, {k:Alt-End} |
